---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GlobalHeader from '../../../components/GlobalHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Lumilinks inc."
  description="Company overview of Lumilinks inc.: company name, address, representative, business activities, and more."
>
  <head>
    <!-- 外部ドメインへの事前接続 -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://x.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://bnn.co.jp" />
  </head>

  <section class="pt-16">
    <GlobalHeader />
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-8 pt-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-normal mb-8">About</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Company name:</h3>
        <p>Lumilinks inc.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Address:</h3>
        <p>
          2F-C, Shibuya Dogenzaka Tokyu Building,<br />1-10-8 Dogenzaka,
          Shibuya-ku, Tokyo 150-0043, Japan
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">CEO / Representative Director:</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <p>
            Kogiso / <a
              href="https://x.com/kgsi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="underline hover:no-underline">X (formerly Twitter)</a
            >
          </p>
          <p>
            After working as a designer and engineer at a contract production
            company, Kogiso joined SAKURA internet to work on product
            development. In 2020 Kogiso joined SmartHR as a product designer,
            leading design system and product work. Following roles as a
            designer at a generative AI startup and a zero-to-one startup,
            Kogiso founded Lumilinks inc. With design at the core, Lumilinks
            supports organizations, builds AI workflows, and assists with hiring
            and public relations.
          </p>
          <p>
            Kogiso is the author of <a
              class="underline hover:no-underline"
              href="https://bnn.co.jp/products/9784802512480"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              ><span lang="ja">『ちいさくはじめるデザインシステム』</span> (Starting
              a Design System Small)</a
            > (BNN) and organizes <a
              class="underline hover:no-underline"
              href="https://crossrel.jp/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">CrossRel</a
            >, a community for the tech industry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Capital:</h3>
        <p>500,000 JPY</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Established:</h3>
        <p>March 17, 2025</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Corporate number:</h3>
        <p>5011001168597</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">
          Qualified invoice issuer registration number:
        </h3>
        <p>T5011001168597</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Business activities:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li>Web and application architecture, UI design, and development</li>
          <li>Brand development and brand consulting</li>
          <li>Design consulting and advisory</li>
          <li>PR and recruitment support</li>
          <li>Community planning and management</li>
          <li>Planning, development, and operation of our own services</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
